        "TileImage": "$($repository 666521d2-1efe-4d0a-b7f7-2afeb08262b6).Image",
        "Description": "47. I&apos;ve heard that the Pirates have captured two ICA agents and that this gang has another big leader, Sinhi &quot;Akka&quot; Venthan. I&apos;ve been informed that these agents of ours named Carlton Smith and Joyo Yani have been telling the Pirates a lot of information, so I want you to eliminate them before they tell any more. I&apos;m sure they&apos;ll recognize you, and try to ask you to release them. Don&apos;t listen to them. Then we have that famous snitch, the villagers have found out who he is, and want him down.",
